[00:11.14]To start it off I know you know me 一开始我就知道你了解我
[00:14.07]To come to think of it, it was only last week. 上星期我才开始意识到
[00:16.71]That I had a dream about us, oh. 我在营造一个两个人的梦想
[00:23.25]That's why I am here, I'm writing this song. 所以我现在在这里，我在写这首歌
[00:26.24]To tell the truth you know I have been hurting all along, 告诉你我一直在受伤
[00:29.74]Someway let me know, you want me girl. 以某种方法告诉我吧，女孩，说你需要我
[00:34.73]Everytime you see me what do you see? 每次你注视我的时候你看到了什么呢？
[00:37.37]I feel like I'm a poor man and you're the queen. 我觉得自己像卑微的臣民而你是我的女皇
[00:40.23]Oh baby, you're the only thing that I really need. 宝贝,你是我生命中唯一的追求
[00:43.46]Baby that's why: 宝贝,那就是为什么
[00:47.18]You make me wanna call you in the middle of the night. 是你让我，让我想要半夜给你打电话
[00:50.31]You make me wanna hold you till the morning light. 是你让我，让我想要拥着你直到天明
[00:53.36]You make me wanna love, you make me wanna fall. 你让我陷入爱河，时欢时喜
[00:56.37]You make me wanna surrender my soul. 你让我甘愿奉献自己的灵魂，不战自降
